From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 01:48:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(Scripts/BRS): Arm Dragonspire room on player enter for
 LFG (I-188)

LFG groups teleport inside the UBRS entrance door, which stays closed
for LFG, so they could never cross the at_dragonspire_hall areatrigger
that arms the Dragonspire Hall rune-event. Emberseer In then never
opened, hard-softlocking every LFG UBRS run. Arm the room from
OnPlayerEnter so it works regardless of entry path.

Closes I-188
---
 src/vanillaScripts/instance_blackrock_spire.cpp | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/vanillaScripts/instance_blackrock_spire.cpp b/src/vanillaScripts/instance_blackrock_spire.cpp
index bd2ad39..765e943 100644
--- a/src/vanillaScripts/instance_blackrock_spire.cpp
+++ b/src/vanillaScripts/instance_blackrock_spire.cpp
@@ -101,6 +101,19 @@ public:
             UBRSDoorOpen = false;
         }
 
+        // I-188: LFG groups are teleported inside the UBRS entrance door, which
+        // stays closed for LFG (see at_dragonspire_hall), so they can never walk
+        // back over the areatrigger that arms the Dragonspire Hall rune-event.
+        // Arm it on player enter so the Emberseer In door can open regardless of
+        // entry path (the SetData handler already guards against re-arming once
+        // the room is DONE).
+        void OnPlayerEnter(Player* player) override
+        {
+            InstanceScript::OnPlayerEnter(player);
+            if (GetBossState(DATA_DRAGONSPIRE_ROOM) != DONE)
+                SetData(AREATRIGGER_DRAGONSPIRE_HALL, DATA_DRAGONSPIRE_ROOM);
+        }
+
         void CreatureLooted(Creature* creature, LootType loot) override
         {
             switch (creature->GetEntry())
